Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, openssh-client, passwd, util-linux
Maintainer: Devin Smith <me@devinsmith.co.za>
Homepage: https://github.com/devinsmith911/lxcwatch
Description: track and update community-scripts LXCs across a Proxmox cluster
 Web dashboard that shows installed app versions, pending package updates
 and Debian release upgrades for every LXC in a Proxmox cluster, and runs
 updates over SSH with optional snapshots and rollback.
